{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}{% block content %}<article class="wrap section legal prose"><p class="eyebrow">Before your appointment</p><h1>{% if legalPage=='policies' %}A little preparation.{% elif legalPage=='privacy' %}Your privacy.{% else %}Terms of your visit.{% endif %}</h1><p class="notice">Draft for owner review before launch. Please call the studio to confirm your appointment arrangements.</p>{% if legalPage=='policies' %}<h2>Your deposit</h2><p>The {{ booking.depositCents | money }} deposit is applied to your appointment total. The working policy is non-refundable; a late cancellation or no-show forfeits the deposit.</p><h2>Changes of plan</h2><p>One free reschedule is allowed with at least {{ policy.rescheduleHours or 48 }} hours’ notice. Call {{ phoneDisplay }} to request a change. Online changes are not available yet.</p><h2>Hair preparation</h2><p>Hair with 50% human hair is included in the style price. Upgrade to 100% human hair for {{ humanHairUpgrade.priceCents | money }} extra. Please arrive washed and detangled unless you have arranged a head wash.</p><h2>Timing</h2><p>Most styles reserve {{ booking.defaultDurationMin / 60 }} hours. If you are running late, please call. Confirm the duration for your style and length when arranging your appointment.</p>{% elif legalPage=='privacy' %}<h2>Using this website</h2><p>You can browse styles and prices without a client account. The website keeps operational logs for troubleshooting and security. The booking form collects your name, email, phone, optional notes and optional inspiration image to create a temporary appointment hold. Payments are completed on Stripe’s secure checkout; card details never pass through this website. Online contact messages are not sent yet.</p><h2>Cookies and external services</h2><p>Essential session cookies support security. When form protection is enabled, Cloudflare Turnstile checks your browser and validates a single-use security token before submission. Your browser session storage retains booking choices and entered details until the hold is created or the tab is closed. Inspiration images are stored privately; optional marketing consent is unticked by default. We do not currently load analytics or advertising trackers. Google Maps loads only when you press “Load interactive map”; Google then receives your browser request. Directions links open Google Maps.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact {{ business.name }} at <a href="tel:{{ business.phone }}">{{ phoneDisplay }}</a>. Before online booking launches, this notice will be updated with the details of booking, payment and email processing.</p>{% else %}<h2>Styles and prices</h2><p>Published prices include the braiding service and hair with 50% human hair. The optional 100% human hair upgrade costs {{ humanHairUpgrade.priceCents | money }} extra. Consultation-priced styles need a final price agreed with the studio. Discuss your size and length before booking.</p><h2>Appointment arrangements</h2><p>Selecting a time does not confirm an appointment. Your chair is confirmed after successful payment. Unpaid checkout holds expire automatically.</p><h2>Studio policies</h2><p>Your appointment is subject to the deposit and rescheduling arrangements confirmed with Mado. Read our <a href="/policies">appointment policies</a> before your visit.</p>{% endif %}<hr><p>{{ business.name }}<br>{{ business.street }}, {{ business.city }}, {{ business.region }} {{ business.postalCode }}<br><a href="tel:{{ business.phone }}">{{ phoneDisplay }}</a></p></article>{% endblock %}
